OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FA major incident has been declared as
OL,7,Femergency services continue to tackle
OL,8,Fa wildfire which has been burning in
OL,9,Fthe Cairngorms National Park for more
OL,10,Fthan a week.
OL,12,FPolice Scotland evacuated homes around
OL,13,FNethy Bridge as a precaution on Friday
OL,14,Fnight after significant changes in
OL,15,Fwind conditions accelerated the spread
OL,16,Fof flames.
OL,18,FThe government said a fire break
OL,19,Faround the village was established
OL,20,Fovernight.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FAs Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fdeploys additional resources, First
OL,8,FMinister John Swinney described the
OL,9,FCairngorms wildfire as a "very serious
OL,10,Fsituation".
OL,12,FPolice said more residents were
OL,13,Fevacuated in a small area of
OL,14,Fproperties north-west of Dorback Lodge
OL,15,F(Lain Thatchan) on Saturday morning as
OL,16,Fa precaution.
OL,18,FA 7am, a meeting of the Scottish
OL,19,FGovernment's Resilience Room was
OL,20,Freconvened to review the position.
OL,26,@qD@ZOUrD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FSwinney said: "Residents, businesses
OL,7,Fand people staying in the affected
OL,8,Fareas will understandably be very
OL,9,Fworried.
OL,11,F"My thoughts are with them and I thank
OL,12,Fthem for their understanding.
OL,14,F"With the fire changing to be in the
OL,15,Fdirection of Nethy Bridge yesterday
OL,16,Fafternoon, a precautionary evacuation
OL,17,Fwas put in place and a fire break was
OL,18,Fsuccessfully established overnight to
OL,19,Fprotect the village.
OL,26,@nD@OOUsD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,F"Police officers visited all
OL,7,Fproperties in Nethy Bridge and
OL,8,Fofficers are in the village today to
OL,9,Fsupport residents.
OL,11,F"The wind has changed direction
OL,12,Fovernight, which means the track of
OL,13,Fthe fire has altered once again and
OL,14,Fthe threat to Nethy Bridge has
OL,15,Freduced, for the moment at least.
OL,17,F"Ground and helicopter resources are
OL,18,Fbeing focused on the current path of
OL,19,Fthe fire and new fire breaks
OL,20,Fconstructed."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUyD@AOU|D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
