OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FOn Saturday, emergency services said
OL,12,Fthere were nine fire appliances at the
OL,13,Fscene, supported by specialist
OL,14,Fwildfire resources.
OL,16,FEmergency services previously said
OL,17,Fthat significantly changed weather
OL,18,Fconditions, including stronger winds,
OL,19,Fhave contributed to the unpredictable
OL,20,Fbehaviour of the blaze.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
