PN,31606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FSFRS said it has maintained a
OL,7,F"significant operational response"
OL,8,Fsince the wildfire was first reported
OL,9,Fon July 15.
OL,11,FMore than 500 firefighters have
OL,12,Ftackled the blaze over the last 10
OL,13,Fdays, alongside specialist wildfire
OL,14,Fappliances, all-terrain vehicles,
OL,15,Fhelicopter water-bombing operations
OL,16,Fand partner agencies.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FSwinney added such situations can
OL,7,Fchange "very quickly and
OL,8,Fdramatically", reflecting the
OL,9,Fchallenges faced by SFRS and the other
OL,10,Fresponders.
OL,12,F"It does not mean, however, that
OL,13,Fanyone should return to that area
OL,14,Funtil they been given the go-ahead to
OL,15,Fdo so," Swinney said.
OL,17,F"Further decisions will be taken later
OL,18,Ftoday by the Local Resilience
OL,19,FPartnership and the Scottish
OL,20,FGovernment Resilience Group will also
OL,21,Freconvene."
OL,26,@oD@HOUpD@MO]tD@AOUwD@GO]yD@AOU}D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FThe First Minister said he was
OL,7,F"extremely grateful" to the emergency
OL,8,Fservices and all those involved in
OL,9,Ftackling the fire.
OL,11,FHe reiterated that people in the area
OL,12,Fmust follow the advice of emergency
OL,13,Fservices and the Cairngorms National
OL,14,FPark.
OL,16,F"It is essential people avoid the
OL,17,Faffected areas," Swinney told
OL,18,Freporters.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@TO]xD@AOUyD@PO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
