PN,31609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FHis comments came as smoke drifted as
OL,7,Ffar as Aberdeen due to changing wind
OL,8,Fconditions.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Government's response
OL,11,Fmeeting was attended by several
OL,12,Fministers and representatives from
OL,13,Femergency services, including SFRS and
OL,14,FPolice Scotland.
OL,16,FThe fire, which broke out near the
OL,17,Fvillage of Glenmore on Wednesday last
OL,18,Fweek, led to residents and campsites
OL,19,Fbeing evacuated.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31610
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FIt covered about six square kilometres
OL,7,Fof heather and small trees at its
OL,8,Fheight.
OL,10,FEvacuated residents are being directed
OL,11,Fto a dedicated respite centre at the
OL,12,FMacdonald Aviemore Resort.
OL,14,FMembers of the public are asked to
OL,15,Favoid affected areas in the Cairngorms
OL,16,FNational Park. SFRS said the area
OL,17,Fremains unsafe due to firefighting
OL,18,Foperations, rapidly changing fire
OL,19,Fconditions and helicopter activity.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
