OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FRichard Eccles has been living in
OL,7,FNethy Bridge with his wife Patricia
OL,8,Ffor 33 years, where they have run a
OL,9,Fguest house.
OL,11,FSpeaking to the Press Association,
OL,12,Fthey said police came to their house
OL,13,Fat around 10pm on Friday and presented
OL,14,Fthem with three options ` they could
OL,15,Feither stay, seek accommodation with
OL,16,Ffriends or family elsewhere or go to
OL,17,Femergency accommodation at the
OL,18,FMacdonald hotel in Aviemore.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31612
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FThey said they decided to stay unless
OL,7,Fthe fire gets considerably closer,
OL,8,Fwhich most residents in the village
OL,9,Fappear to have done.
OL,11,FMr Eccles said: "We've got a camper
OL,12,Fvan and we're all ready and set to go
OL,13,Fat a moment's notice."
OL,15,FHe continued: "If it gets smoky, we'll
OL,16,Fgo."
OL,26,@sD@QOUuD@VO]wD@OOUxD@DO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31613
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F316A1785109700
OL,3,CPolice declare 'major incident' for
OL,4,CCairngorms wildfire as wind changes
OL,6,FA wedding was due to take place at
OL,7,FCastle Roy, which is near the village,
OL,8,Fbut Mr Eccles said this has had to be
OL,9,Fcancelled as a result of the wildfire
OL,10,Fevacuations.
OL,12,FHe said the Scottish Government's
OL,13,Fresponse had been "poor" and a major
OL,14,Fincident should have been declared
OL,15,Fearlier, with military assistance
OL,16,Fbrought in to tackle the fire before
OL,17,Fit spread.
OL,19,FMr Eccles said: "It's a bit like
OL,20,Fclosing the stable door now that the
OL,21,Fhorse has bolted."
OL,26,@uD@SOUuD@XO]{D@QOU}D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/14
